    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "The Organization Talent Brand Analytic Summaries API provides analytics data for organization career pages on LinkedIn. Career pages (also known as Life Pages) are dedicated pages that showcase an organization\u0027s employer brand, culture, and open positions to potential candidates.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "Career pages consist of two main sections:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "Life tab: Displays company culture, employee stories, photos, and workplace policies.\nJobs tab: Shows current job openings at the organization.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "This API returns aggregated visitor statistics for career pages, specifically the total number of people who viewed the organization\u0027s Life and Jobs tabs within a specified time range. This data helps organization administrators understand the reach and effectiveness of their employer branding efforts.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "The API is available for LinkedIn company pages, schools, and showcase pages that have career page features enabled.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "Career pages are a paid product feature. For more information, see Company Career Pages.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Use This API",
      "Anchor": "how-to-use-this-api",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Use This API"
      ],
      "Text": "To retrieve talent brand analytics data, you need to:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Use This API",
      "Anchor": "how-to-use-this-api",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Use This API"
      ],
      "Text": "Verify access permissions: Ensure the authenticated user has one of the required roles, as described in the Permissions section.\n\nFind eligible organizations: To determine the organizations for which you can query analytics, use the OrganizationAuthorization API\u0027s BATCH_FIND by AuthorizationAction and AuthenticatedMember with an authorization action of OrganizationAnalyticsAuthorizationActionType.TALENT_BRAND_ANALYTICS_READ. This returns a list of organization URNs the authenticated member is permitted to access.\n\nQuery the API: Use the organization URN and desired time range to retrieve analytics data. Examples are provided in this documentation.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Use This API",
      "Anchor": "how-to-use-this-api",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Use This API"
      ],
      "Text": "The Organization Talent Brand Analytic Summaries API returns visitor statistics for organizations, including company, school, and showcase pages.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Use This API",
      "Anchor": "how-to-use-this-api",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Use This API"
      ],
      "Text": "The service currently provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Use This API",
      "Anchor": "how-to-use-this-api",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Use This API"
      ],
      "Text": "OrganizationAndTimeRange - Retrieves talent brand analytics data summaries (career page visitors) for a specific organization and time range.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
