            "Text": "Time range for analytics data. Valid values: THREE_MONTHS (present to 3 months ago), SIX_MONTHS (present to 6 months ago), or ONE_YEAR (present to 1 year ago). The previousCount in the response will cover an equivalent period before the specified timeRange.",
